        <mxCell id="relationship" value="&lt;b&gt;Relations that are actually available&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Within watering_events, (device_id, boot_id, cycle_id) groups a cycle. Adding event makes the row unique.&lt;br&gt;Readings have no boot_id or cycle_id, so a reading cannot be joined reliably to a watering cycle using uptime alone." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#233B43;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=1.8;fillColor=#FFF4DF;strokeColor=#B77D29;rounded=0;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
